  <content>
  <section><para>Evaluate Mentally.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><title>Warm Up Activity</title><exercise id="6006a113-4491-4700-8f62-0b956ffd4bfc" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Enter your answer here:</para><para>\( \frac{102-96}{45-42}\) </para>
      </problem><solution><para>Correct!\( 2\)</para><para>Nice try! The correct answer is \( 2\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="95f98277-0f7a-4357-b97f-cecf4e55464e" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Enter your answer here:</para><para> \(\frac{-8-4}{6-2}\) </para>
      </problem><solution><para>Correct! \(-3\)</para><para>Nice try! The correct answer is \(-3\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="cac39456-6b6b-4e19-955b-6ddfac66044d" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Enter your answer here:</para><para> \(\frac{31-18}{5-10}\) </para>
      </problem><solution><para>Correct! \(-\frac{13}{5}\)</para><para>Nice try! The correct answer is \(-\frac{13}{5}\)</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="e4137444-0943-49b6-a07c-005d62bbaca3" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Enter your answer here:</para><para> \(\frac{4-9}{12-18}\) </para>
      </problem><solution><para>Correct! \(\frac{4-9}{12-18}\)</para><para>Nice try! The correct answer is \(\frac{4-9}{12-18}\)</para></solution></exercise></section></section>
